That is the record that restarted on August 18th, 2026, under published rules, a fixed

00:07:53.266 --> 00:07:59.746
five session hold, entry at the next open, exit at the stop or at the horizon, and no discretionary

00:07:59.746 --> 00:08:04.546
exits, so a listener with the pick, the date and the stop can reproduce every number.

00:08:04.546 --> 00:08:12.186
The full history since March 2026 is 104 trades, a 54% win rate, and cumulative profit

00:08:12.186 --> 00:08:14.826
of $221 US dollars and 12 cents.

00:08:15.386 --> 00:08:19.646
And the book is still treating valuation setups with a volume filter as the pattern worth

00:08:19.646 --> 00:08:23.726
keeping, and cost cut only revisions as the pattern that has not paid.

00:08:24.733 --> 00:08:29.553
A TFSA that is now heavy in one utility still has to be checked against the asset class

00:08:29.553 --> 00:08:33.833
weights you wrote at the start of the quarter, not against the feeling that the name had a

00:08:33.833 --> 00:08:39.253
good week. Export current holdings and values from the broker, then compare each asset

00:08:39.253 --> 00:08:44.373
class percentage to those written targets so drift shows up in basis points, using the

00:08:44.373 --> 00:08:48.813
exact dollar values on the final trading day of the quarter rather than month and summaries

00:08:48.813 --> 00:08:54.013
that smooth the path. Calculate time-weighted return for the whole account and money-weighted

00:08:54.013 --> 00:08:58.613
return for each holding so new contributions do not get confused with price performance.

00:08:58.613 --> 00:09:04.093
Then line up, realized versus unrealized gains to decide whether tax loss harvesting is

00:09:04.093 --> 00:09:05.933
even on the table before year end.

00:09:06.533 --> 00:09:11.373
Some the cash dividends actually received over the trailing 12 months and divide by average

00:09:11.373 --> 00:09:15.133
capital deployed to get a realized yield you can track quarter to quarter.

00:09:15.733 --> 00:09:20.853
Check total fees against the prior quarter and flag any position that now exceeds 5% of

00:09:20.853 --> 00:09:21.353
the account.

00:09:21.993 --> 00:09:27.073
When a single holding clears that 5% line, the review requires an explicit choice to trim,

00:09:27.073 --> 00:09:33.413
to add somewhere else or to accept the concentration with a written rationale, and the output is a one-page

00:09:33.413 --> 00:09:37.473
decision log that lists each holding and the single action chosen for it.

00:09:38.093 --> 00:09:40.973
Treating the review as a performance scorecard is the trap.

00:09:41.713 --> 00:09:47.033
Treating it as a rebalancing and tax planning checkpoint that forces one decision per name is the fix.

00:09:48.053 --> 00:09:52.273
Open the brokerage, pull the last three months of statements on one registered account,

00:09:52.833 --> 00:09:56.453
and calculate that time-weighted return for the quarter in under 15 minutes.

